&lt;div id=&quot;outline-container-what-went&quot; class=&quot;outline-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-went&quot;&gt;What went&lt;a class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#what-went&quot; aria-label=&quot;Link to this section&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;outline-text-2&quot; id=&quot;text-what-went&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;org-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The fake Emacs frame: menu bar, modeline, echo area, hamburger menu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breadcrumbs, the reading progress bar, sidenotes, code copy buttons, the image lightbox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A random colour scheme on every visit, the themes gallery, and the rain confetti on badges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;outline-container-what-stayed-because-i-want-it&quot; class=&quot;outline-2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-stayed-because-i-want-it&quot;&gt;What stayed, because I want it&lt;a class=&quot;heading-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#what-stayed-because-i-want-it&quot; aria-label=&quot;Link to this section&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;outline-text-2&quot; id=&quot;text-what-stayed-because-i-want-it&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;org-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;My fonts, the heading glyphs, and the five font modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;base16 colour schemes, with Haki as the default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The command palette with its glass blur, one place to search and navigate everything.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The spinning glow on hover, the badges, and the WANTED poster on the 404 page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
